    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;7.05</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Summary of the main features of <em>SMARCB1</em>- and <em>LZTR1</em>-related schwannomatosis</span></p>",
