    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Box&nbsp;7.02</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Diagnostic criteria for schwannomatosis (2022), based on data from Plotkin et al. </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{35674741}</span></span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Not necessary, based on data in article",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 697.9pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"931\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 697.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"931\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Diagnostic criteria for schwannomatosis with <em>SMARCB1</em> or <em>LZTR1</em> variants:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 676.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"902\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">At least one pathologically confirmed schwannoma or hybrid nerve sheath tumour <strong>AND</strong> <em>SMARCB1</em> or <em>LZTR1</em> pathogenic variant in unaffected tissue</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 676.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"902\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 676.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"902\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">A shared <em>SMARCB1</em> or <em>LZTR1</em> variant in two schwannomas or hybrid nerve sheath tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 697.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"931\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Diagnostic criteria for 22q-related schwannomatosis:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 676.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"902\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">An individual who does NOT meet criteria for neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;2 (schwannomatosis related to neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;2), <em>SMARCB1</em>-related schwannomatosis or <em>LZTR1</em>-related schwannomatosis, does NOT have <em>DGCR8</em> pathogenic variant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 676.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"902\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AND</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> has both of the following molecular features:</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 655.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"874\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Loss of heterozygosity of the same chromosome&nbsp;22q markers in two schwannomas or hybrid nerve sheath tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 655.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"874\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AND</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 655.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"874\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">A different <em>NF2</em> pathogenic variant in each tumour, which cannot be detected in unaffected tissues</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
